Strategy: // CSD_RATIONALE_BEGIN
// Revised from the 71%-accuracy baseline with one targeted response to the new
// traces: keep the successful delimiter-triggered design, but add a late-stage
// opening bias outside constrained mode so the model is much more likely to
// emit at least one arithmetic `<< ... >>` computation before stopping.
//
